WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.4 · Marketing & Communications
Storytelling and ethical storytelling

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Tell the story of the problem and why you started, putting people's dignity and safety first.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Get informed consent for every use; allow withdrawal.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Let people tell their story in their own words.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Do not publish when the risk outweighs the benefit.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your storytelling rules and set up a consent log.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
